---
# TEMPLATE (.mdyt) — data-bearing: the values below are sample defaults, so the
# template renders as-is for preview; real data overrides them at apply time.
mdy:
  kind: template
  engine: handlebars
  schema: generic
  name: Simple visit note
  version: 1.0.0
patient_name:
  value: Jordan Rivera
visit_date:
  value: 2026-07-02
height:
  value: 180
  unit: cm
  display: "5'11\""
weight:
  value: 89.8
  unit: kg
  display: 198 lb
---
# Visit Note

**Patient:** {{patient_name}} · **Date:** {{visit_date}}

## Vitals

- Height: {{height}}
- Weight: {{weight}}
